[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 FSM (Functional Specification Manual)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FSM-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Facility Requirements
STATEMENT: The system shall operate in secure facilities with appropriate environmental controls.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FSM-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Hardware Infrastructure
STATEMENT: The system shall use enterprise-grade hardware with redundancy and failover capabilities.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FSM-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Network Infrastructure
STATEMENT: The system shall operate on secure networks with appropriate segmentation and monitoring.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FSM-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Environmental Controls
STATEMENT: The system shall operate in controlled environments with appropriate temperature and humidity controls.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.